    color-mix(in srgb, #0F4C81 15%, transparent) 0%, 
    transparent 100%); border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);">3. 开放协议落地，互联互通成为可能</h3><p class="p" style="margin: 2em 12px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: #3f3f3f; line-height: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;">2025年，两大关键协议的落地为Agent生态奠定基础：</p><p class="p" style="margin: 2em 12px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: #3f3f3f; line-height: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;"><strong style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: 700; font-size: inherit; text-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);">模型上下文协议（MCP）</strong>：统一Agent与外部工具、数据源的交互标准。</p><p class="p" style="margin: 2em 12px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: #3f3f3f; line-height: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;"><strong style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: 700; font-size: inherit; text-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);">智能体间协议（A2A）</strong>：实现不同Agent之间的直接通信和协作。</p><p class="p" style="margin: 2em 12px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: #3f3f3f; line-height: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;">这两大协议的普及，使得&quot;Agent互联网&quot;从概念走向现实。</p><h2 class="h2" data-heading="true" style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 0.8em 1.5em; margin: 3em auto 2em; color: #fff; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 100%); font-size: calc(16px * 1.4); font-weight: 700; text-align: center; border-left: 6px solid #0F4C81; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2),
    inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase;">二、核心架构演进：从自动化到自主化</h2><p class="p" style="margin: 2em 12px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: #3f3f3f; line-height: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;">现代AI Agent的核心架构由四大模块组成，构建起&quot;感知－决策－行动－记忆&quot;的认知闭环。</p><h3 class="h3" data-heading="true" style="position: relative; padding: 0.6em 0 0.6em 1.5em; margin: 2.5em 8px 1.5em; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.3); font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.4; border-left: 6px solid #0F4C81; background: linear-gradient(90deg, 
    color-mix(in srgb, #0F4C81 15%, transparent) 0%, 
    transparent 100%); border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);">感知模块</h3><p class="p" style="margin: 2em 12px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: #3f3f3f; line-height: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;">采集多源信息并进行结构化处理：</p><ul class="ul" style="list-style: none; padding-left: 2em; margin: 2em 8px;"><li class="listitem" style="position: relative; margin: 1em 0; padding-left: 0.8em; line-height: 2;"><span style="position: absolute; left: -1.3em; color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: 0.8em;">●</span>• 文本数据：用户输入、文档内容</li><li class="listitem" style="position: relative; margin: 1em 0; padding-left: 0.8em; line-height: 2;"><span style="position: absolute; left: -1.3em; color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: 0.8em;">●</span>• 视觉数据：图像、视频流</li><li class="listitem" style="position: relative; margin: 1em 0; padding-left: 0.8em; line-height: 2;"><span style="position: absolute; left: -1.3em; color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: 0.8em;">●</span>• 环境数据：系统状态、外部API返回</li></ul><h3 class="h3" data-heading="true" style="position: relative; padding: 0.6em 0 0.6em 1.5em; margin: 2.5em 8px 1.5em; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.3); font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.4; border-left: 6px solid #0F4C81; background: linear-gradient(90deg, 
    color-mix(in srgb, #0F4C81 15%, transparent) 0%, 
    transparent 100%); border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);">大脑模块</h3><p class="p" style="margin: 2em 12px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: #3f3f3f; line-height: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;">以大语言模型为核心，实现：</p><ul class="ul" style="list-style: none; padding-left: 2em; margin: 2em 8px;"><li class="listitem" style="position: relative; margin: 1em 0; padding-left: 0.8em; line-height: 2;"><span style="position: absolute; left: -1.3em; color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: 0.8em;">●</span>• <strong style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: 700; font-size: inherit; text-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);">意图理解</strong>：准确把握用户真实需求</li><li class="listitem" style="position: relative; margin: 1em 0; padding-left: 0.8em; line-height: 2;"><span style="position: absolute; left: -1.3em; color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: 0.8em;">●</span>• <strong style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: 700; font-size: inherit; text-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);">任务拆解</strong>：将复杂目标分解为可执行步骤</li><li class="listitem" style="position: relative; margin: 1em 0; padding-left: 0.8em; line-height: 2;"><span style="position: absolute; left: -1.3em; color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: 0.8em;">●</span>• <strong style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: 700; font-size: inherit; text-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);">策略规划</strong>：选择最优执行路径</li></ul><h3 class="h3" data-heading="true" style="position: relative; padding: 0.6em 0 0.6em 1.5em; margin: 2.5em 8px 1.5em; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.3); font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.4; border-left: 6px solid #0F4C81; background: linear-gradient(90deg, 
    color-mix(in srgb, #0F4C81 15%, transparent) 0%, 
